{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step into the shadows of Prohibition. </strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The year is 1923. Alcohol is illegal, but business keeps flowing. Behind closed doors, barrels of illicit liquor are crafted, and the law is always watching. It\u2019s time to build your own underground operation.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Speakeasy Simulator</strong>, you\u2019ll manage every detail of your secret bar and distillery. Your goal is simple: produce, sell, and expand while staying one step ahead of the police.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Produce &amp; Distill Alcohol </strong><br> Transform fruits, vegetables, cereals, and other ingredients into fine illegal spirits. Control the quantity, quality, and production flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/7323d04599e2cc33e376239fee3ca37e.poster.avif?t=1760025394\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/7323d04599e2cc33e376239fee3ca37e.webm?t=1760025394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/7323d04599e2cc33e376239fee3ca37e.mp4?t=1760025394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design Your Bar &amp; Laboratory </strong><br> Arrange your speakeasy and distillery to optimize production, storage, and service. A well-organized space means smoother operations and happier customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/01104e703f316c2fbbcc0628064131bf.poster.avif?t=1760025394\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/01104e703f316c2fbbcc0628064131bf.webm?t=1760025394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/01104e703f316c2fbbcc0628064131bf.mp4?t=1760025394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell Your Products</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In bulk to the mafia</strong> for fast cash. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Per glass in your bar</strong> to satisfy the local clientele and earn more money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/2ae942d3d4a0878fea8aea59b64273d4.poster.avif?t=1760025394\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/2ae942d3d4a0878fea8aea59b64273d4.webm?t=1760025394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/2ae942d3d4a0878fea8aea59b64273d4.mp4?t=1760025394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customer Demands Matter </strong><br> Each visitor has specific expectations (type of alcohol, quantity, and quality). Meeting their needs builds reputation and profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/9da0c906b5683be6c79b16f9ea74e6c1.poster.avif?t=1760025394\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/9da0c906b5683be6c79b16f9ea74e6c1.webm?t=1760025394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/9da0c906b5683be6c79b16f9ea74e6c1.mp4?t=1760025394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evade Police Patrols </strong><br> Be careful of police patrols outside, especially at night, and try to avoid them while smuggling contraband to your local reseller.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Roadmap</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During Early Access, we plan to expand and improve Speakeasy Simulator with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bar Decoration &amp; Customization</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add furniture, lights, and decorative elements to personalize your bar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new customization options by gaining <strong>reputation with your customers</strong>. </p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reputation System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track how satisfied your clients are with your service.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reputation will unlock new bar and lab upgrades, special items and higher quality ingredients. </p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attractivity System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The way you decorate your bar affects which clients are attracted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Higher-end customers with more specific demands and deeper pockets will visit if your bar is attractive enough. </p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhanced Police AI</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More realistic patrol patterns and risk management when transporting contraband.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some crooked cops are well aware of your activities and will need some\u2026 compensation to look the other way. </p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Alcohol Production</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded alcohol production methods like aging and maceration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some customers may crave variety and start asking for cocktails to shake up their usual orders. </p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balance, Polish &amp; Quality-of-Life Improvements</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuous updates to improve gameplay, fix bugs, and enhance the player experience.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Early Access?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re a small indie team of two programmers. After our time working in a game studio, we decided to take the leap and create a game of our own.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our resources are limited, that\u2019s why we\u2019re launching in Early Access: so we can grow the game together with the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback will directly shape the future of Speakeasy Simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Current State</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is fully playable, with a <strong>2 to 5 hours experience</strong> depending on your playstyle. You can produce alcohol, manage your bar and lab, sell to customers or mafia, and dodge the police.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The city is thirsty. The law is watching. </strong></i><br><i> Will your operation thrive or get busted?</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3883070?t=1760025394","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/fd2bf2dec322f4c8e9660499db7208cbd358c4a2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760025394","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/057c47ccadd00daff14bd450d617badab4f8a132/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760025394","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/057c47ccadd00daff14bd450d617badab4f8a132/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760025394","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step into the shadows of Prohibition. </strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The year is 1923. Alcohol is illegal, but business keeps flowing. Behind closed doors, barrels of illicit liquor are crafted, and the law is always watching. It\u2019s time to build your own underground operation.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Speakeasy Simulator</strong>, you\u2019ll manage every detail of your secret bar and distillery. Your goal is simple: produce, sell, and expand while staying one step ahead of the police.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Produce &amp; Distill Alcohol </strong><br> Transform fruits, vegetables, cereals, and other ingredients into fine illegal spirits. Control the quantity, quality, and production flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/7323d04599e2cc33e376239fee3ca37e.poster.avif?t=1760025394\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/7323d04599e2cc33e376239fee3ca37e.webm?t=1760025394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/7323d04599e2cc33e376239fee3ca37e.mp4?t=1760025394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design Your Bar &amp; Laboratory </strong><br> Arrange your speakeasy and distillery to optimize production, storage, and service. A well-organized space means smoother operations and happier customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/01104e703f316c2fbbcc0628064131bf.poster.avif?t=1760025394\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/01104e703f316c2fbbcc0628064131bf.webm?t=1760025394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/01104e703f316c2fbbcc0628064131bf.mp4?t=1760025394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell Your Products</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In bulk to the mafia</strong> for fast cash. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Per glass in your bar</strong> to satisfy the local clientele and earn more money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/2ae942d3d4a0878fea8aea59b64273d4.poster.avif?t=1760025394\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/2ae942d3d4a0878fea8aea59b64273d4.webm?t=1760025394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/2ae942d3d4a0878fea8aea59b64273d4.mp4?t=1760025394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customer Demands Matter </strong><br> Each visitor has specific expectations (type of alcohol, quantity, and quality). Meeting their needs builds reputation and profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/9da0c906b5683be6c79b16f9ea74e6c1.poster.avif?t=1760025394\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/9da0c906b5683be6c79b16f9ea74e6c1.webm?t=1760025394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/9da0c906b5683be6c79b16f9ea74e6c1.mp4?t=1760025394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evade Police Patrols </strong><br> Be careful of police patrols outside, especially at night, and try to avoid them while smuggling contraband to your local reseller.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Roadmap</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During Early Access, we plan to expand and improve Speakeasy Simulator with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bar Decoration &amp; Customization</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add furniture, lights, and decorative elements to personalize your bar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new customization options by gaining <strong>reputation with your customers</strong>. </p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reputation System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track how satisfied your clients are with your service.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reputation will unlock new bar and lab upgrades, special items and higher quality ingredients. </p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attractivity System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The way you decorate your bar affects which clients are attracted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Higher-end customers with more specific demands and deeper pockets will visit if your bar is attractive enough. </p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhanced Police AI</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More realistic patrol patterns and risk management when transporting contraband.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some crooked cops are well aware of your activities and will need some\u2026 compensation to look the other way. </p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Alcohol Production</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded alcohol production methods like aging and maceration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some customers may crave variety and start asking for cocktails to shake up their usual orders. </p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balance, Polish &amp; Quality-of-Life Improvements</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuous updates to improve gameplay, fix bugs, and enhance the player experience.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Early Access?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re a small indie team of two programmers. After our time working in a game studio, we decided to take the leap and create a game of our own.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our resources are limited, that\u2019s why we\u2019re launching in Early Access: so we can grow the game together with the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback will directly shape the future of Speakeasy Simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Current State</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is fully playable, with a <strong>2 to 5 hours experience</strong> depending on your playstyle. You can produce alcohol, manage your bar and lab, sell to customers or mafia, and dodge the police.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The city is thirsty. The law is watching. </strong></i><br><i> Will your operation thrive or get busted?</i></p>","developers":["Arcana Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/a0a4cd38e665b2445725068244b352addc1152df/header.jpg?t=1760025394","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3883070/110675736/e7c28502bd9998e25f32495b317a6a92222ae40a/1757778422/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758560377","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3883070/110675736/e7c28502bd9998e25f32495b317a6a92222ae40a/1757778422/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758560377","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor